===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|odt|nl}} *''skeran'', from {{proto|Germanic|skeranan|lang=nl}}. Akin to English {{term|shear||lang=en}}.

====Verb====
{{nl-verb|st-i}}

# to [[shave]]
#:* zich scheren &mdash; ''to shave oneself''
# to [[shear]]

